+- warning: backwards-clock timestamp rule undefined. Addressed in AC-004.
+- warning: clock contract and `burst` optionality undefined. Addressed in AC-001; the yaml golden tables still need the invalid-clock row.
+- warning: `.machine.yaml` golden tables are a subset of the SPEC ACs (burst cap at 10**9, `retry_after` validation in AC-007, several AC-001 rejections). Test authors should use the SPEC text.
+- suggestion: whitespace, case and leading-zero rules for the rate string are unspecified (whitespace and case are tolerated for the duration half via `parse_duration`).
+- suggestion: oracle evidence cites "the ask" with no artifact. Values are hand-derivable arithmetic.
+
+## 🔍 Refinement Decisions
+- Lane `light`: one new file plus one test file, single session, `irreversible_decisions: []`. Interview skipped; the ask settles every WHAT slot. Autopilot is `auto_full`, so no approval question was asked.
+- Float exactness: naive refill gives `0.3 - 0.2 = 0.09999999999999998`, so `0.3` would be denied. Locked a 1e-9-token availability tolerance plus clamping at `>= 0` on take.
+- Backwards clock: clamp to zero elapsed (not specified in the ask).
+- Non-int / `bool` `burst` and `n`: `ValueError`.
